Value Required INTERFACE (\S+)
Value IN_PKTS (\d+)
Value IN_MCAST_PKTS (\d+)
Value IN_BCAST_PKTS (\d+)
Value IN_BPS (\d+)
Value IN_PPS (\d+)
Value IN_CRC_ERR_PKTS (\d+)

Start
  ^Interface\s+InPkts\s+InMcastPkts
  ^${INTERFACE}\s+${IN_PKTS}\s+${IN_MCAST_PKTS}\s+${IN_BCAST_PKTS}\s+${IN_BPS}\s+${IN_PPS}\s+${IN_CRC_ERR_PKTS}\s*$$ -> Record
